# Unik Plane Burning — enemy air unit, id 42 (`Unik_8`): a BURNING plane — two `Burn2` + one `Burn1`, no weapon.
# Rig transcribed verbatim from the decompiled `com.enemy.Unik_8.init()`
# (session export of design/noAds.swf):
#
#   Burn2: x = -18;  y = 0;  rotation = 90
#   B_unik_nd: x = -28;  y = -13 -> centre (0, -1.5)
#   Burn2: x =   0;  y = 0;  rotation = 90
#   Burn1: x = -15;  y = 1;  rotation = 90
#
# Offsets are Flash (y-DOWN) relative to the UNIT ORIGIN; bitmaps are placed by
# their TOP-LEFT and then centred, so the lines above resolve each to a CENTRE.
# This prefab's ROOT is the body sprite (Flash centre (0, -1.5)), so every
# child below is rebased onto that centre and flipped to pix3 y-up:
#   pix3 = (fx, -(fy + 1.5))
#
# APPROXIMATION:
#   the first `Burn2` is added BEFORE the airframe (behind it); the body is this
#   prefab's ROOT and always paints under its children, so all three flames
#   paint over the airframe here.
#
# Per-id stats (hp/speed/score/attack) are applied by WaveSpawner from SdBalance.
# GENERATED by scripts/gen-levels.mjs — edit the rig table there, not this file.
version: 1.0.0
metadata:
  author: Sky Defender Remaster
  description: "Unik Plane Burning (unit prefab, Unik_8)"
